```python id=app_golden
import numpy as np
H = np.array([[1, 1], [1, -1]], dtype=complex) / np.sqrt(2)
CS = np.diag([1, 1, 1, 1j]).astype(complex)
golden = CS @ np.kron(H, H)
```
